el、PPT 等，具备较强的办公软件操作技巧。\n3、对各类 A|工具，如 ChatGPT、Notion Al、Automate等有实际使用经验，了解其功能特点与应用方法。\n4、具备较强的逻辑思维能力和问题解决能力，能够将复杂的工作流程拆解，通过 AI 工具实现优化与自动化。\n5、良好的沟通能力与团队协作精神，能够有效地向同事传授 AI 工具的使用方法，推动团队整体效率提升。\n6、对新技术充满热情，学习能力强，能够快速掌握新的 AI工具并应用到实际工作中。", "recruitmentCountDesc": "", "encryptAddressId": "b46ea2878ce222a51nR73ti1FlZX", "address": "洛阳洛龙区洛阳健稷电子商务有限公司", "longitude": 112.500216, "latitude": 34.623015, "staticMapUrl": "https://img.bosszhipin.com/beijin/amap/staticMap/6ebde1b129c57ec4b990135627b80d55", "pcStaticMapUrl": "https://img.bosszhipin.com/beijin/amap/staticMap/f01760b205ed1209afdc3cea0869294f", "baiduStaticMapUrl": "", "baiduPcStaticMapUrl": "", "overseasAddressList": [], "overseasInfo": null, "showSkills": [], "anonymous": 0, "jobStatusDesc": "招聘中"}, "bossInfo": {"name": "张女士", "title": "人事", "tiny": "https://img.bosszhipin.com/boss/avatar/avatar_2.png", "large": "https://img.bosszhipin.com/boss/avatar/avatar_2.png", "activeTimeDesc": "刚刚活跃", "bossOnline": false, "brandName": "健稷电子商务", "bossSource": 0, "certificated": true, "tagIconUrl": null, "avatarStickerUrl": null}, "brandComInfo": {"encryptBrandId": "911cd27d7ed85eff3nZ-2dq1EA~~", "brandName": "健稷电子商务", "logo": "https://img.bosszhipin.com/beijin/upload/com/logo/20220824/7b5b554d84f9729cfd7ed9d6545fafd502e9329d6f469150e39e492be7a952527b8ccc15dc9b5c0c.jpg", "stage": 801, "stageName": "未融资", "scale": 302, "scaleName": "20-99人", "industry": 100001, "industryName": "电子商务", "introduce": "洛阳健稷农业科技产业园是由河南永丰面业股份有限公司、京师洛阳上市孵化基地和健稷农业科技有限公司共同发起成立的现代农业综合体，是河南永丰面业股份有限公司从传统涉农加工向“轻重结合” ，“粮头食尾”的全产业链生态型企业转型的重要成果。\n形成集农产品种植、订单收购、仓储贸易、粮油加工、科技研发、电商物流、主食销售为一体的现代化农业综合体。", "labels": ["意外险", "绩效奖金", "底薪加提成", "团建聚餐", "有无线网", "节日福利"], "activeTime": 1788676802697, "visibleBrandInfo": true, "focusBrand": false, "customerBrandName": "健稷电子商务", "customerBrandStageName": "未融资"}, "oneKeyResumeInfo": {"inviteType": 0, "alreadySend": false, "canSendResume": false, "canSendPhone": false, "canSendWechat": false}, "relationInfo": {"interestJob": fals